# Hullbreaker Horror's first mode returns the spell to its owner's hand; it does not counter it (CR 701.6, 400.3), so
# Bot2's Abrupt Decay, which can't be countered, goes back to Bot2's hand all the same. Bot1 has the Horror from turn 1;
# on turn 3 it casts Opt, Bot2 responds with Abrupt Decay at Bot1's Mox Ruby, and Bot1's Lightning Bolt cast chooses
# mode 1 aimed at the Decay. The Decay never resolves: Bot1's Mox Ruby stays and the stack ends empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Hullbreaker Horror
Lightning Bolt
Opt
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Emerald
Abrupt Decay
Swamp x20

